{
    "test_name": "MOB.980_DIAG_OnLine_Override",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.980_DIAG_OnLine_Override",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.980` **DIAGNOSTIC \u2014 can a step make the APP read `navigator.onLine === false`?**\n- `MOB.910`'s `offline` event flips `useNetwork()` only; `AssetLookup` (ConnectionRequired),\n  `MaterialCharges`, `AssetGeolocate` and `graphql/index.tsx`'s RetryLink read the property.\n- Judged ONLY by the app: Asset Lookup opened from its Home tile (no reload) shows\n  ConnectionRequired or the normal page. Route A = getter from the step; route B = getter\n  from an injected `<script>` (page world). Outcomes are optional steps, so the run records\n  which happened.\n- \ud83d\uded1 **READ-ONLY**, and restores with `always` steps + a reload + a hard online gate.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Diagnostic",
            "Offline",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Navigate to the home screen",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/"
                },
                "type": "goToUrl"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let home render",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 4
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "GATE: the home screen rendered",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": "Welcome,"
                },
                "type": "assertPageContains",
                "timeout": 60
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "BASELINE: navigator.onLine is true and the Asset Lookup tile is on Home",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "const tiles = () => [...document.querySelectorAll('img[alt^=\"icon for \"]')].map(i => i.getAttribute('alt') || '');\nreturn navigator.onLine === true && tiles().some(a => /Asset Lookup/i.test(a));"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": true,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": false,
                "name": "A: define an own `onLine` getter (false) on navigator, from the step's code",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "Object.defineProperty(navigator, 'onLine', { configurable: true, get: function () { return false; } });\nreturn navigator.onLine === false;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 15
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": true,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": false,
                "name": "A: ask the PAGE world what it reads (a <script> writes it to a DOM attribute)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "document.documentElement.removeAttribute('data-dd980-online');\nconst s = document.createElement('script');\ns.textContent = \"document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-dd980-online', String(navigator.onLine));\";\ndocument.head.appendChild(s);\ns.remove();\nreturn true;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 15
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": true,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": false,
                "name": "A: the PAGE world reads false \u2014 the step shares the page's world (optional)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-dd980-online') === 'false';"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 10
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": true,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": false,
                "name": "A: the PAGE world reads true \u2014 the step runs in an ISOLATED world (optional)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-dd980-online') === 'true';"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 10
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": true,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": false,
                "name": "A: NO page-world answer \u2014 inline <script> is blocked (CSP) (optional)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-dd980-online') === null;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 10
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "A: open Asset Lookup from its Home TILE (an in-app route change, no reload)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "element": {
                        "url": "https://dev.mentorapm.com/apm-mobile/",
                        "userLocator": {
                            "failTestOnCannotLocate": true,
                            "values": [
                                {
                                    "type": "xpath",
                                    "value": "//img[starts-with(@alt, \"icon for \") and contains(@alt, \"Asset Lookup\")]"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "type": "click",
                "timeout": 30
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "Let Asset Lookup render",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "value": 4
                },
                "type": "wait"
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": true,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": false,
                "name": "A \u2b50 REACHED ConnectionRequired \u2014 the app read `navigator.onLine === false` (optional: records the outcome)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return /\\/asset-lookup/.test(location.pathname)\n  && (document.body.textContent || '').includes('This feature requires an internet connection.')\n  && !document.querySelector('input[name=\"asset-search\"]');"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 20
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": true,
                "alwaysExecute": false,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": false,
                "name": "A: the NORMAL Asset Lookup rendered \u2014 the app did NOT see the override (optional: records the outcome)",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "return /\\/asset-lookup/.test(location.pathname)\n  && !!document.querySelector('input[name=\"asset-search\"]');"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 20
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
                "alwaysExecute": true,
                "exitIfSucceed": false,
                "isCritical": true,
                "name": "A: remove the step-world getter",
                "noScreenshot": false,
                "params": {
                    "code": "try { delete navigator.onLine; } catch (e) {}\nreturn true;"
                },
                "type": "assertFromJavascript",
                "timeout": 15
            },
            {
                "allowFailure": false,
